### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Acute client config ping
GET http://localhost:3000/acute-test/ping

### Dry run raw Acute request to /ledger for one date window
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/ledger",
  "params": {
    "dateType": "invoiceDate",
    "startDate": "2026-05-17",
    "endDate": "2026-05-18"
  },
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### Raw Acute request to /ledger for one date window
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/ledger",
  "params": {
    "dateType": "invoiceDate",
    "startDate": "2024-04-01",
    "endDate": "2024-05-01"
  },
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### Dry run raw Acute request to /ledger including events
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/ledger",
  "params": {
    "dateType": "invoiceDate",
    "showEvents": true,
    "startDate": "2024-04-01",
    "endDate": "2024-05-01"
  },
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### Raw Acute request to /ledger including events
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/ledger",
  "params": {
    "dateType": "invoiceDate",
    "showEvents": false,
    "startDate": "2024-04-01",
    "endDate": "2024-05-01"
  },
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

